Additional Information:

Before running the scraping workflow, ensure that Chrome is installed and configured for remote debugging.

The submodule is designed to work as part of the larger poe2trade project, so internal paths and utility functions should not be modified without proper coordination.

For issues or improvements, please open an issue in the project repository.